{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Wasteland Punk",
    "steam_appid": 2971970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/decccef0df181d1267eb5df6da0ec500.avif?t=1754905555\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Wasteland Punk \u2014 the ultimate RPG of survival in a world shattered by catastrophe! Face a gripping story full of twists, fierce enemies, and intense turn-based combat. Unleash your tactical brilliance with weapons forged or scavenged from the ruins of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/480eb32e37d5c2b7a47600c5ce73d439.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/480eb32e37d5c2b7a47600c5ce73d439.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/480eb32e37d5c2b7a47600c5ce73d439.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world torn apart by solar flares, essentials like clean water and food are luxuries worth killing for. Scavenge the remnants of a fallen civilization, where every corner hides danger and secrets. Battle ruthless factions and secretive organizations fighting for dominance, unleashing monsters and covert operations from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/7742d0a853465bbc4180ec0b363e9601.avif?t=1754905555\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/934f7ce5aaa904f9ae2098347b82b808.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/934f7ce5aaa904f9ae2098347b82b808.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/934f7ce5aaa904f9ae2098347b82b808.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your squad of mercenaries through a vast open world in your armored pickup. Take on daring missions, build your reputation, and gather resources to craft powerful weapons and develop a thriving base. Decide who joins your team and who\u2019s left to perish in the wasteland\u2019s scorched sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/bd3048b4ae137fa0d5386e3f37dc6576.avif?t=1754905555\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each location packed with enemies and clues to dark secrets. Question settlers, raid bandit camps, and uncover surprises. Be ready for battle at all times! Use fire, poison, electricity, and more to exploit your enemies\u2019 weaknesses. Combine unique abilities, wield powerful weapons, and upgrade your squad with the classic RPG system.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/74287d5fc94376ff00d25af400422eaf.avif?t=1754905555\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/1cc4b15315c412b93ab1afaac85e674d.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/1cc4b15315c412b93ab1afaac85e674d.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/1cc4b15315c412b93ab1afaac85e674d.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of strategy! Set traps, distract foes, and adapt your tactics. Collect resources, enhance your base, and create hundreds of weapons and gear. Equip swords, rifles, rocket launchers, and more with deadly modifiers. Withstand sniper shots and turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/a6d928aa53b88f381c3d2fe95a7591c1.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/a6d928aa53b88f381c3d2fe95a7591c1.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/a6d928aa53b88f381c3d2fe95a7591c1.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer Wasteland Punk or fall to the wasteland\u2019s embrace? Add the game to your wishlist and prepare for the ultimate post-apocalyptic adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/decccef0df181d1267eb5df6da0ec500.avif?t=1754905555\" data-has-big width=800 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/b6f5726ab3e50fc28ed908b3409230ff.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Wasteland Punk \u2014 the ultimate RPG of survival in a world shattered by catastrophe! Face a gripping story full of twists, fierce enemies, and intense turn-based combat. Unleash your tactical brilliance with weapons forged or scavenged from the ruins of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/480eb32e37d5c2b7a47600c5ce73d439.poster.avif?t=1754905555\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/480eb32e37d5c2b7a47600c5ce73d439.webm?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971970/extras/480eb32e37d5c2b7a47600c5ce73d439.mp4?t=1754905555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world torn apart by solar flares, essentials like clean water and food 